"submitter_user":"LenFalken","user_is_author":false,"tags":["science","video"],"short_id_url":"https://lobste.rs/s/w09mkn","comments_url":"https://lobste.rs/s/w09mkn/why_is_time_one_way_street"},{"short_id":"reiajh","created_at":"2016-11-25T16:43:07.000-06:00","title":"The AV1 Codec","url":"http://aomedia.org/","score":5,"flags":0,"comment_count":0,"description":"\u003cp\u003eI thought it was neat that this will probably be the most-used video codec on the web by this time next year—a sneak peek at the future of the web, if you will. More info can be found \u003ca href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/AOMedia_Video_1\" rel=\"ugc\"\u003ehere\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIf you’re in the mood to try it out, just \u003ccode\u003egit clone\u003c/code\u003e the \u003ca href=\"https://aomedia.googlesource.com/aom\" rel=\"ugc\"\u003esource code repo\u003c/a\u003e and follow the \u003ca href=\"http://aomedia.org/contributor-guide/\" rel=\"ugc\"\u003ebuild instructions\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n","description_plain":"I thought it was neat that this will probably be the most-used video codec on the web by this time next year—a sneak peek at the future of the web, if you will. More info can be found [here](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/AOMedia_Video_1).\r\n\r\nIf you’re in the mood to try it out, just `git clone` the [source code repo](https://aomedia.googlesource.com/aom) and follow the [build instructions](http://aomedia.org/contributor-guide/).","submitter_user":"nil","user_is_author":false,"tags":["browsers","web"],"short_id_url":"https://lobste.rs/s/reiajh","comments_url":"https://lobste.rs/s/reiajh/av1_codec"},{"short_id":"os65c2","created_at":"2016-11-25T16:32:58.000-06:00","title":"How To Set Up an OpenVPN Server on Ubuntu 16.04","url":"https://www.digitalocean.com/community/tutorials/how-to-set-up-an-openvpn-server-on-ubuntu-16-04","score":0,"flags":1,"comment_count":0,"description":"","description_plain":"","submitter_user":"InkyHarmonics","user_is_a